on/design-review-2.md:2316:    /// Serialize to YAML string.\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2859:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:2321:    /// Deserialize from YAML string.\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2860:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:2346:    fn test_roundtrip_yaml() {\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2861:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:2377:        assert_eq!(yaml1, yaml2, \\\"YAML serialization must be deterministic\\\");\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2862:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:2407:    fn test_assembly_roundtrip() {\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2863:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:2428:        // Roundtrip: serialize then deserialize yields the same YAML\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2882:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:2834:    /// T01: Determinism — identical inputs produce identical solids (field-by-field).\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2883:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:2862:    /// T02: Topology counts.\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2884:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:2881:    /// T03: Euler–Poincaré formula V - E + F = 2(S - H), S=1, H=0 → 2.\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2885:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:2900:    /// T04: Manifold condition — each edge referenced by exactly 2 HEs with opposite orientation,\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2886:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:2955:    /// T05: Geometry — seam vertices and surface coefficients.\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2890:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:3913:    /// T06: Normal tessellation — triangle count for cylinder with default 32 angular segments.\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:2891:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-2.md:3932:    /// T07: Determinism — same input → same