8:    /// T03: Euler–Poincaré formula V - E + F = 2(S - H), S=1, H=0 → 2.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6127:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2829:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1582:features/12-cylinder/final-review-2.md:967:    /// T04: Manifold condition — each edge referenced by exactly 2 HEs with opposite orientation,\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6128:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2831:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1591:features/12-cylinder/design-review.md:176:| T01 | 決定性(primitive) | `make_cylinder(5,20)` を `IdGenerator::new(0)` で2回生成し全 ID・座標・面が一致 | `assert_eq!` |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6129:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2832:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1592:features/12-cylinder/design-review.md:177:| T02 | トポロジー | 頂点2・エッジ3・面3・シェル1(closed)・HE6・loop3 | 各 `len()` 一致 |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6130:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2833:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1593:features/12-cylinder/design-review.md:178:| T03 | Euler | V−E+F == 2 | `assert_eq!(2-3+3, 2)` 相当の検証 |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6131:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2834:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1594:features/12-cylinder/design-review.md:179:| T04 | マニフォルド | 各エッジがちょうど 2 HE に参照され向きが逆 | 集計検証 |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6132:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2835:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1595:features/12-cylinder/design-review.md:180:| T05 | 幾何 | シーム頂点が (0,r,0)/(0,r,h)、各 Surface/Curve の係数 | `approx` で一致 |\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6133:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:2836:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:1596:features/12-cylinder/design-review.md:181:| T06 | テッセレーション正常系 | `tessellate_solid