ad\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3175:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1634:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:1798:crates/mycad-kernel/src/geometry/surface.rs:168:    fn assert_uv_roundtrip(surface: &Surface, u: f64, v: f64) {\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3176:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1635:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:1799:crates/mycad-kernel/src/geometry/surface.rs:176:    fn test_uv_of_roundtrip_plane() {\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3177:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1636:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:1800:crates/mycad-kernel/src/geometry/surface.rs:183:        assert_uv_roundtrip(&surface, 0.7, -1.3);\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3178:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1637:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:1801:crates/mycad-kernel/src/geometry/surface.rs:187:    fn test_uv_of_roundtrip_cylinder() {\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3179:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1638:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:1802:crates/mycad-kernel/src/geometry/surface.rs:193:        assert_uv_roundtrip(&surface, 0.9, 1.7);\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3180:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1639:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:1803:crates/mycad-kernel/src/geometry/surface.rs:197:    fn test_uv_of_roundtrip_sphere() {\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3181:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1640:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:1804:crates/mycad-kernel/src/geometry/surface.rs:202:        assert_uv_roundtrip(&surface, 1.1, 0.6);\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3182:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1641:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:1805:crates/mycad-kernel/src/geometry/surface.rs:206:    fn test_uv_of_roundtrip_cone() {\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3183:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1642:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:1806:crates/mycad-kernel/src/geometry/surface.rs:212:        assert_uv_roundtrip(&surface, 0.8, 2.0);\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3184:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1643:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:1936:./features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:179:- R03(high) **部分採用 / 反論**: 「`HalfEdge` に twin/next/prev を追加」は **却下**。本 kernel は index-based でループの順序配列から隣接を導く設計（ADR-001、既存 `make_cuboid`・`tessellate_solid` も隣接フィールド非依存）であり、隣接ポインタ追加は #12 のスコープを超える全 brep 改修・retessellation を招く。R03 の本質（参照数集計だけでは loop 閉包・seam 接続を検証できない）は妥当なので、**T04 をループ閉包の幾何検証へ強化**して代替担保する（隣接構造の導入は将来 Boolean/フィレットが必要とした時点で別途検討）。\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3185:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1644:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:2308:    suggestion: \\\"この変更を意図的な winding 修正として明記し、`T08` を『counts は維持するが indices / STL facet normal は変わり得る』前提に更新するか、先に cuboid 側の loop orientation を正規化して本当に不変にすること。\\\"\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3186:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1645:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:2311:    section: \\\"テスト計画 > T03\\\"\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3187:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1646:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:2312:    finding: \\\"T03 の期待結果が `assert_eq!(2-3+3, 2)` 相当になっており、生成した `Solid` の `V/E/F/S/H` を参照していない。これでは Euler-Poincaré 検証にならない。\\\"\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3188:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1647:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:2333:    suggestion: \\\"この変更を意図的な winding 修正として明記し、`T08` を『counts は維持するが indices / STL facet normal は変わり得る』前提に更新するか、先に cuboid 側の loop orientation を正規化して本当に不変にすること。\\\"\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3189:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1648:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:2336:    section: \\\"テスト計画 > T03\\\"\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3190:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1649:features/12-cylinder/design-review-2.md:2337:    finding: \\\"T03 の期待結果が `assert_eq!(2-3+3, 2)` 相当になっており、生成した `Solid` の `V/E/F/S/H` を参照していない。これでは Euler-Poincaré 検証にならない。\\\"\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3191:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1656:features/12-cylinder/final-review-2.md:712:    fn assert_uv_roundtrip(surface: &Surface, u: f64, v: f64) {\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3192:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1657:features/12-cylinder/final-review-2.md:720:    fn test_uv_of_roundtrip_plane() {\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3193:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1658:features/12-cylinder/final-review-2.md:727:        assert_uv_roundtrip(&surface, 0.7, -1.3);\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3194:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1659:features/12-cylinder/final-review-2.md:731:    fn test_uv_of_roundtrip_cylinder() {\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3195:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1660:features/12-cylinder/final-review-2.md:737:        assert_uv_roundtrip(&surface, 0.9, 1.7);\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3196:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1661:features/12-cylinder/final-review-2.md:741:    fn test_uv_of_roundtrip_sphere() {\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3197:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1662:features/12-cylinder/final-review-2.md:746:        assert_uv_roundtrip(&surface, 1.1, 0.6);\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3198:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1663:features/12-cylinder/final-review-2.md:750:    fn test_uv_of_roundtrip_cone() {\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3199:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1664:features/12-cylinder/final-review-2.md:756:        assert_uv_roundtrip(&surface, 0.8, 2.0);\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3200:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1665:features/12-cylinder/final-review-2.md:901:    /// T01: Determinism — identical inputs produce identical solids (field-by-field).\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3201:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1666:features/12-cylinder/final-review-2.md:929:    /// T02: Topology counts.\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3202:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1667:features/12-cylinder/final-review-2.md:948:    /// T03: Euler–Poincaré formula V - E + F = 2(S - H), S=1, H=0 → 2.\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3203:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1668:features/12-cylinder/final-review-2.md:967:    /// T04: Manifold condition — each edge referenced by exactly 2 HEs with opposite orientation,\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3204:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1669:features/18-api-skeleton/plan.md:9:> Codex 設計レビュー round 1-3 反映済み(3回上限)。round3 残存指摘は全て受諾し最終修正済み: R01=絶対パスのみ受理(決定的)、R02=v0 専用テッセレーション定数で Default 依存排除、R03=InvalidReference→422、R04=T09/T10 で assembly と空 part を分離、R05=K01 に INFINITY 分岐追加。round3 の verdict は fail のままだが指摘内容は本改訂で解消済み(ユーザー判断で再レビューせず確定)。\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3205:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1670:features/18-api-skeleton/plan.md:26:| `make_cuboid` 全呼び出し箇所 | `.unwrap()`/`.expect()` で追従。`tessellation/mod.rs`(L358,373-374,500,514-515)、`tessellation/stl.rs`(L58,75)、`tests/cuboid_roundtrip.rs`(L9,31)、`benches/tessellation.rs`(L15)。**全て更新し `cargo xtask ci` green を保つ** |\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3206:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1672:features/18-api-skeleton/plan.md:107:| T01 | 正常系(box) | `GET /api/v0/mesh?file=<abs>/examples/simple_box.mycad` を oneshot | 200、`TriangleMesh` deser 可、`positions`/`indices` 非空、`indices.len() % 3 == 0` |\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3207:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1673:features/18-api-skeleton/plan.md:108:| T02 | 正常系(cylinder)(R05) | 同上 `examples/cylinder.mycad`(周期面経路) | 200、mesh 非空 |\\nfeatures/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3208:features/18-api-skel